      "side": 1,
      "message": "We already have Inventory.Accelerator too (If it was wrong before, let\u0027s not add to it but this broader than just Inventory.Bmc) \n\nRedfish uses PhysicalContext on Sensors \n\"The usage or location within a device to which this sensor measurement applies.\"\n\nA use case is an Accelerator\u0027s Sensor \n\nRedfish also uses PhysicalContext on Assembly. Redfish Assembly is a random collection of other inventory that doesn\u0027t belong other places. \n\n\"This property shall contain a description of the physical context for the assembly data.\"\n\nA use case is an BMC board that is modeled as a Redfish Assembly",
